WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
Beneran?

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.400
(Episode 15)

00:00:01.160 --> 00:00:01.880
Ini...

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:03.960
Langsung berikan 
Grup Hash?

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:05.560
Itu adalah

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.280
perusahaan yang nilainya puluhan triliun

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:09.840
Pacar Selia itu

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:11.200
sebenarnya siapa?

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:12.800
Apa cuma aktor bayaran

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:13.640
yang sengaja di sewa

00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:15.160
buat akting 
di depan kita?

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:17.120
Makin pamer saja

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:20.000
Itu artinya Keluarga Dara gak percaya diri

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.120
dan takut diejek orang

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:23.240
Oh iya

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:26.240
kenapa kamu sampai gagap begitu?

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:28.960
Dasar penakut

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:30.240
Domi Hash ini

00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:31.520
sebenarnya siapa?

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:32.720
Hanya satu kalimatnya

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:34.000
dia serahkan Grup Hash

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:34.640
begitu saja?

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:36.000
Hmph

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:38.000
Domi Hash

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:39.880
Domi Hash apaan?

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:41.040
Grup Hash

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:42.880
sekarang nilainya puluhan triliun

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:44.080
Di belakangnya

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:45.680
ada keluarga konglomerat 

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:46.720
Grup Saga 

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:48.640
Mana mungkin 
bisa diberikan

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:50.440
begitu saja

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:52.040
Hmph, Sayang

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:52.840
tenang saja

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:53.760
Aku

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.640
akan telepon 
manajer umum 

00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:56.640
Grup Hash

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:57.960
Bilang saja

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:00.560
ada tua bangka yang nyamar jadi dia

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:04.520
Halo, Tuan Honggo

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:06.360
kamu gak tahu... 
Ini...

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:08.520
Silakan Nona Selia tanda tangan

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:11.360
Tunggu!

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:17.280
Akting yang 
bagus sekali

00:01:17.440 --> 00:01:18.040
Hebat

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:19.680
Hebat sekali, Selia

00:01:19.960 --> 00:01:21.440
Demi gengsi

00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:23.200
kamu sampai sewa banyak aktor

00:01:23.320 --> 00:01:24.480
untuk berakting

00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:26.960
Tapi, kamu lupa satu hal

00:01:27.640 --> 00:01:30.080
Suamiku itu, 
karyawan tetap

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:31.040
di Grup Hash

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:33.320
dan dia, sama sekali gak kenal

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:34.360
sama Domi Hash ini

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:36.280
Dia itu palsu!

